    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSet on an elevated site with attractive views to the front, this newly built three-bedroom semi-detached home offers stylish, energy-efficient living in true turnkey condition. \nFinished to a high standard throughout, the property is bright, modern and exceptionally well presented, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families or those looking \nfor a home ready for immediate occupation. \nThe spacious interior is flooded with natural light, with tiled flooring flowing throughout the entire ground floor and a well-balanced layout designed for modern family living. \nThe sitting room opens through to a bright kitchen and dining area, while French doors provide direct access to the rear garden. Outside, the property benefits from a cobblelock driveway to the front, side access and a private rear garden laid in lawn."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 4.38m x 2.83m\nBright and welcoming entrance hall with tiled flooring running throughout the ground floor.\n\nGuest WC - 1.77m x 1.47m\nLocated off the entrance hall and fitted with WC and wash hand basin.\n\nLiving Room - 4.22m x 3.64m\nComfortable reception room positioned to the front of the property, providing a cosy yet spacious living area.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 4.94m x 6.57m\nBright open-plan space fitted with built-in floor and wall units offering excellent storage. The dining area enjoys French doors opening to the rear garden.\n\nUtility Room - \nConvenient utility room located off the kitchen.\n\nLanding - 3.63m x 2.20m\nBright landing area providing access to all first-floor accommodation.\n\nMaster Bedroom - 4.45m x 4.28m\nSpacious double bedroom overlooking the rear garden with laminate flooring, built-in wardrobes and ensuite.\n\nEn-Suite - 2.69m x 0.91m\nFitted with WC, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.87m x 3.26m\nGenerous double bedroom to the front of the property with built-in wardrobes and pleasant elevated views.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.90m x 3.21m\nThird spacious bedroom located to the front of the home with laminate flooring.\n\nBathroom - 2.69m x 2.20m\nWell-appointed family bathroom with tiled flooring, part tiled walls, WC, wash hand basin and bath with overhead shower.\n\nOutside - \nTo the front, a cobblelock driveway provides off-street parking for two vehicles, while side access leads to the rear garden. The rear garden is fully enclosed, fenced and laid in lawn, offering a safe and private outdoor space.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Newly built in 2025</li><li> A-rated home </li><li> Air-to-water heating system </li><li> Turnkey condition throughout </li><li> Elevated site with views to the front </li><li> Cobblelock driveway with parking for two cars </li><li> Enclosed rear garden with side access</ul>"
      },
